      "text": "## Layer 1: IoU — The Metric Everything Rests On"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md#006",
      "path": [
        "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:computer-vision:07-detection-and-tracking, git-history:computer-vision:07-detection-and-tracking]",
        "canonical_path": "computer-vision/07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md",
        "concepts": "[object detection, R-CNN, YOLO, non-maximum suppression, IoU, mAP, Kalman filter, optical flow, tracking]",
        "current_path": "computer-vision/07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md",
        "id": "maxim:computer-vision:detection-and-tracking",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "computer-vision",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[object detection]",
        "section": "computing-software",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Detection and Tracking",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Intersection over Union** measures how well a predicted box matches a ground-truth box.\nIt is the atom of every detection metric, the matching criterion in NMS, and the\nassignment cost in tracking."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md#007",
      "path": [
        "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:computer-vision:07-detection-and-tracking, git-history:computer-vision:07-detection-and-tracking]",
        "canonical_path": "computer-vision/07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md",
        "concepts": "[object detection, R-CNN, YOLO, non-maximum suppression, IoU, mAP, Kalman filter, optical flow, tracking]",
        "current_path": "computer-vision/07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md",
        "id": "maxim:computer-vision:detection-and-tracking",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "computer-vision",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[object detection]",
        "section": "computing-software",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Detection and Tracking",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   IoU = area(intersection) / area(union)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md#008",
      "path": [
        "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:computer-vision:07-detection-and-tracking, git-history:computer-vision:07-detection-and-tracking]",
        "canonical_path": "computer-vision/07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md",
        "concepts": "[object detection, R-CNN, YOLO, non-maximum suppression, IoU, mAP, Kalman filter, optical flow, tracking]",
        "current_path": "computer-vision/07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md",
        "id": "maxim:computer-vision:detection-and-tracking",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "computer-vision",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[object detection]",
        "section": "computing-software",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Detection and Tracking",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "+----------+\n        |  GT      |          intersection = overlap region\n        |    +-----+----+     union = total area covered by both\n        |    | // |    |\n        +----+----+    |      IoU = 0   -> no overlap\n             | pred    |      IoU = 1   -> perfect match\n             +---------+      IoU > 0.5 -> conventionally a \"correct\" detection\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md#009",
      "path": [
        "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:computer-vision:07-detection-and-tracking, git-history:computer-vision:07-detection-and-tracking]",
        "canonical_path": "computer-vision/07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md",
        "concepts": "[object detection, R-CNN, YOLO, non-maximum suppression, IoU, mAP, Kalman filter, optical flow, tracking]",
        "current_path": "computer-vision/07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md",
        "id": "maxim:computer-vision:detection-and-tracking",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "computer-vision",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[object detection]",
        "section": "computing-software",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Detection and Tracking",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "A detection is counted **correct** if its IoU with a ground-truth box of the same class\nexceeds a threshold (commonly 0.5). Higher thresholds (0.75, or the 0.5:0.95 average used\nby COCO) demand tighter localization."
    },
