      "text": "## Layer 2: NMS — Removing Duplicate Boxes"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md#012",
      "path": [
        "07-DETECTION-AND-TRACKING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
